</p>
<div class="mt-3">
<button class="btn btn-success me-2" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#applyModal">Apply</button>
<button class="btn btn-outline-success">Demo trial</button>
</div>
<div class="d-flex stat-wrap gap-3 mt-3">
<div>
<div class="stat">48</div>
<div class="stat-label">Stuffs</div>
</div>
<div class="border-start border-success ps-3">
<div class="stat">12</div>
<div class="stat-label">Things</div>
</div>
<div class="border-start border-success ps-3">
<div class="stat">4.9</div>
